WEBVTT

00:06:29.719 --> 00:06:33.356
because there are 27 organizations
all around the world

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:35.058
that are creating these things.

00:06:35.058 --> 00:06:39.963
They're in Nigeria, in Brazil,
in India, in dozens of other countries.

00:06:39.996 --> 00:06:44.801
And it all started with that simple,
powerful question:

00:06:44.834 --> 00:06:46.603
Is what I'm doing right now

00:06:46.636 --> 00:06:49.839
the most important thing
I should be doing?